cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, its folds, or its code, please cite both the
  software record and the paper.
title: "M2OR-Provenance: a three-task benchmark for olfactory receptor activity prediction"
abstract: >-
  Fixed folds, an evaluation harness, a leakage checker and per-fold uncertainty
  for three distinct prediction tasks over the M2OR database of olfactory
  receptor bioassay records: generalising to a new molecule, generalising to a
  new source publication, and predicting whether a reported activity replicates.
  Includes a chemistry-free receptor-prior baseline, an independent
  re-implementation of the headline label-reliability statistics, and the code
  that regenerates every figure in the accompanying paper.
